---
module: resource_loading
func_id: find-base64-blob
---

***conformance tests***

# long-run-is-a-blob
The text `curl -d 'img=` followed by 8292 `A` characters and `'` holds a :Base64Blob: of 8292 characters.

# short-run-is-not-a-blob
The text `token=` followed by 8092 `A` characters holds no :Base64Blob:.

# data-uri-header-is-included
The text `x data:image/png;base64,` followed by 8192 `A` characters and `==` holds a :Base64Blob: of 8216 characters, starting with `data:image/png;base64,`.

***acceptance tests***
